---
import attention from "../../assets/images/redesign/activity/attention.svg";
import robot from "../../assets/images/redesign/activity/activity-robot.png";
import halftone from "../../assets/images/redesign/hero/halftone-shadow.png";
---

<section class="activity-hero redesign-shared-background" aria-labelledby="activity-title" style={`--activity-halftone: url(${halftone.src})`}>
    <div class="activity-hero__copy">
        <img class="activity-hero__attention" src={attention.src} alt="" />
        <h1 id="activity-title"><span>Atividade</span> Legislativa</h1>
        <p>Use filtros e explore as movimentações do legislativo sensíveis a gênero, atualizadas diariamente pela nossa robô que monitora o Congresso.</p>
    </div>
    <img class="activity-hero__robot" src={robot.src} alt="Ilustração de um robô feito de papel" />
    <div class="activity-hero__halftone" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

<style>
    .activity-hero, .activity-hero * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    .activity-hero {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        width: 100%;
        height: 384px;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        overflow: hidden;
        padding: 0 48px 24px;
        color: #0b0f5e;
    }
    .activity-hero__copy { display: flex; width: 681px; max-width: calc(100% - 420px); flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px; }
    .activity-hero__attention { display: block; width: 96px; height: 8px; object-fit: fill; }
    .activity-hero h1 { margin: 0; font-family: "ETC Anybody", "Anybody", sans-serif; font-size: 72px; font-weight: 700; font-variation-settings: "wdth" 75; letter-spacing: 0; line-height: 72px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .activity-hero h1 span { font-variation-settings: "wdth" 60; }
    .activity-hero p { width: 640px; max-width: 100%; margin: 0; font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; }
    .activity-hero__robot { position: absolute; top: -48px; right: 158px; display: block; width: 360px; height: 450px; object-fit: contain; }
    .activity-hero__halftone { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; height: 24px; background-image: var(--activity-halftone); background-position: left bottom; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-size: 1440px 24px; mix-blend-mode: multiply; pointer-events: none; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .activity-hero { height: 360px; padding: 40px 32px; }
        .activity-hero__copy { max-width: calc(100% - 280px); }
        .activity-hero h1 { font-size: 52px; line-height: 56px; }
        .activity-hero__robot { top: 0; right: 24px; width: 280px; height: 350px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px) {
        .activity-hero { height: 416px; padding: 32px 16px 24px; align-items: flex-start; }
        .activity-hero__copy { z-index: 1; width: 343px; max-width: 100%; gap: 16px; }
        .activity-hero__attention { width: 96px; height: 4px; }
        .activity-hero h1 { width: 260px; font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -.8px; line-height: 44px; }
        .activity-hero p { width: 245px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; }
        .activity-hero__robot { top: 146px; right: -22px; width: 205px; height: 256px; }
        .activity-hero__halftone { height: 12px; background-size: 720px 12px; }
    }
</style>
